  and I'm sure that Rangers will will have  much less things to do around the  pelican colony and protection is vital  webcam images show just how sensitive  the pelicans are to any form of  disturbance for now the few people who  venture into the conservation area tend  to be fishermen who mainly come at night  they scare away the pelicans which fly  off and abandon the eggs they're  hatching  close to the colony we encounter a  fishing net that shouldn't be here it  contains a few fish water scorpions a  water rat  and the snake sensitive Dalmatian  pelicans eager investors fishermen in  need of a livelihood by the end of my  trip I've realized that Lakes Qatar is  by no means as deserted as I'd thought  it's likely that a lot will change here  in the years to come  I hope that whatever development takes  place it won't spoil this breathtakingly  beautiful region  [Music]  you

